{
  "name": "Amazon Product Reviews Aspect Sentiment & Competitor Defect R&D Miner",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Amazon Product Reviews Aspect Sentiment & Competitor Defect R&D Miner\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nMine thousands of Amazon customer reviews to quantify exact product defect rates and feature requests before manufacturing.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/amazon-product-review-aspect-sentiment-miner`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/amazon-product-review-aspect-sentiment-miner) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Amazon Product Reviews & Sentiment Scraper** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "447d5cb9-b3fe-4fb9-a5b3-18dff08c6f33",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Amazon Product Reviews & Sentiment Scraper** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "7852b683-0025-493d-aa5f-b27476e23377",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "a0b1d8e0-05a4-40b9-ac95-a8ba51c9a6ae",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "760654d6-2889-4be8-acf0-c0d4337721f3",
